{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_24148","headline":"和高仆射罢节度让尚书授少保分司喜遂游山水之作 · 白居易","name":"和高仆射罢节度让尚书授少保分司喜遂游山水之作","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"蹔辞八座罢双旌，便作登山临水行。\n能以忠贞酬重任，不将富贵碍高情。\n朱门出去簪缨从，绦帐归来歌吹迎。\n鞍辔闹装光满马，何人信道是书生。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"白居易","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_24148.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_24148","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}